{"success":true,"data":{"id":90,"name_en":"Lemongrass Kombucha","name_cn":"香茅康普茶","sku":"2-60","category":"Drinks","top_category":"Drinks","subcategory":"Kombucha","size":"330 ml","barcode":null,"price":29,"compare_at_price":null,"stock":124,"display_order":-1230007,"description_en":"<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Lemongrass Kombucha 🍋</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Product type: Fermented tea beverage ❄️</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Net weight: 300ml ⚖️</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Origin: Guangzhou, China 🌍</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE ⚠️</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">For orders delivered outside Guangzhou, please refrigerate the bottle until fully chilled before opening.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lower temperatures help slow the release of natural carbonation.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pressure may build up during fermentation, so open carefully.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We recommend pouring into a glass before drinking.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION 🧾</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This is citrus brightness in a bottle.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Clean. Sparkling. Refreshing.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This lemongrass kombucha is traditionally fermented and infused with whole fresh lemongrass during the second fermentation.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The result is crisp, lightly tart, and refreshing — never overly sweet.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT 🌾</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We stick to traditional fermentation.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Time, temperature, and real ingredients shape the final flavor.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The result is clean, citrus-forward, and naturally carbonated.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>WHY SUGAR IS USED 🧪</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sugar is used only to support fermentation.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It serves as food for the kombucha culture, allowing fermentation to take place.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">During the process, most of the sugar is consumed by the culture and converted into organic acids, carbonation, and flavor compounds.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Only a small amount of residual sugar remains in the final drink.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>BRAND NOTE ✨</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This product was previously sold under the GoVegan label.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The recipe has not changed.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The process has not changed.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It now carries the Roots name — and a clearer attitude.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>INGREDIENTS 🌱</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Filtered water, black tea, kombucha culture, sugar (&lt;5%), fresh lemongrass</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>HOW TO DRINK 🥤</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Serve chilled.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Open carefully due to natural carbonation.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Best poured into a glass before drinking.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>STORAGE ❄️</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Keep refrigerated at 0–4°C.<br>Shelf life: See packaging.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>NUTRITION (Per bottle 300ml) 🧮</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Energy 21kcal<br>Carbohydrate 5.0g<br>Sugars 5.0g (naturally occurring from fermentation)</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>INTENDED USE / NOTES 📌</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Fermented tea beverage<br>Naturally carbonated</p>","description_cn":"<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>香茅康普茶 🍋</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">产品类型：发酵茶饮 ❄️</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">净含量：300ml ⚖️</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">产地：中国广州 🌍</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>重要提示 ⚠️</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">广州以外地区收到产品后，请先冷藏至充分冰凉再开启。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">低温有助于减缓自然气泡释放。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">发酵过程中会产生气压，开瓶时请注意。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">建议先倒入杯中再饮用。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>产品描述 🧾</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这是装在瓶子里的柑橘感。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">清亮、起泡、非常干净。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这款香茅康普茶采用传统发酵方式，在二次发酵阶段加入整根新鲜香茅。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">口感清爽、微酸、利落，不甜腻。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>有什么不一样 🌾</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">我们坚持传统发酵方式。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">时间、温度和真实原料决定最终风味。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">成品干净利落，柑橘香气明显，气泡自然。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>为什么要加入白砂糖 🧪</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">白砂糖仅用于支持发酵过程。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">它是康普茶菌种的“食物”，帮助发酵顺利进行。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在发酵过程中，大部分糖会被菌种消耗，并转化为有机酸、气泡和风味物质。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">最终成品中仅保留少量残留糖分。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>品牌说明 ✨</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这款产品曾使用 GoVegan 标签。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">配方没变，工艺没变。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">只是换上了 Roots 的名字和更鲜明的态度。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>配料表 🌱</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">过滤水、红茶、康普茶菌种、糖（&lt;5%）、新鲜香茅</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>饮用方式 🥤</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">冷藏后饮用。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">开启时注意气泡。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">建议倒入杯中再喝。</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>贮存与保质期 ❄️</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">贮存条件：全程 0–4°C 冷藏保存</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">保质期：见包装</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>营养信息（每瓶 300ml）🧮</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">能量 21kcal<br>碳水化合物 5.0g<br>糖 5.0g（发酵自然产生）</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>食用提示 📌</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">发酵茶饮<br>天然含气</p>","description_format":"rich","free_of":"nuts, soy, gluten, 5 spice","tags":"auto","ship_from_supplier":null,"image_data":null,"image_url":"/api/retail/products/90/image?v=1781757233","image_aspect":null,"nutrition":null,"keywords_en":null,"keywords_cn":null,"tagline_en":null,"tagline_cn":null,"description_blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"spec_strip","_seed":"fake-2026-05-20","cells":[{"k_en":"Brew","k_cn":"酿造","v_en":"14 days","v_cn":"14 天"},{"k_en":"Volume","k_cn":"净含量","v_en":"330 ml","v_cn":"330 毫升"},{"k_en":"Sugar","k_cn":"糖","v_en":"< 3 g/100ml","v_cn":"< 3 克/百毫升"}]},{"id":"b2","type":"hero_intro","kicker_en":"Brewed in-house","kicker_cn":"我们自己酿","body_en":"A long, cool first ferment, then a second ferment with whole fruit. Lightly fizzy, dry on the finish — the kind of kombucha that actually replaces your fourth coffee.","body_cn":"整颗水果二次发酵低温长时间一次发酵，再用整颗水果做二次发酵。气泡轻、尾韵干 —— 真的能代替你下午第四杯咖啡。","highlight_en":"second ferment